 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></clipPath><path id="path_RatingStar_undefined0small" d="M24 9.63469C24 9.35683 23.7747 9.13158 23.4969 9.13158H15.0892L12.477 1.34327C12.4269 1.19375 12.3095 1.0764 12.16 1.02625C11.8966 0.937894 11.6114 1.07983 11.523 1.34327L8.91088 9.13158H0.503157C0.33975 9.13158 0.186521 9.21094 0.0922364 9.3444C-0.0680877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></defs><use clip-path="url(#clip_RatingStar_undefined0small)" href="#path_RatingStar_undefined0small" class="RatingStar__backgroundFill"></use><path class="RatingStar__fill"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3859761399">February 25, 2021</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Thank you Meredith for encouraging me to read this Omegaverse. I saw this book and turned a blind eye but I'm glad you brought this book to my attention again. 💜<br /><br /><br /><br />A wonderful Omegaverse mash with aliens plus a fat dose of mafia genre, so different and interesting. <br />Set in a parallel Alphaverse universe, Anarcheim is a galaxy seeded with different alien species. The inhabitants - Alphas who lead, Beta's serve and Omega's submit. In this dark, currupted place among the many galaxies only the strong survives. <br /><br />Another low growl erupted as he skimmed his lips along the curve of her shoulder. “I’ve wanted you like this since I first saw you.”<br />Another shiver. More slick pearled on her folds. “I was a child.”<br />“I never was.” His every dominant gesture only triggered her heat higher. “And thank fuck, you’re not any longer.”<br /><br />15-years later 24-year-old Dahlia Lundin and 28-year-old Nikolai Skolov meet again this time with different intentions. Nikolai seeks revenge from Dahlia's father and he needs something from her that would make her betray her family. <br /><br />His growl shifted to a purr. “My property. My prize. Your bastard of a father sold you to me to pay for his sins—and I intend to collect.”<br />“I’m not just some rut toy.”<br />“You’re whatever I want you to be."<br /><br />Dahlia is an Omega, unfortunate, for she was a mere pawn to bargain against odds and of a power society by her father. A large debt has her father sold her which brings her face to face to a man she once met as a little girl. Having never forgotten him she unexpectantly realises that this Alpha is no more the little boy. <br /><br />"Wait.” Her heart slammed in her throat. “I . . . I need a weapon.” It was worth a try.<br />His fangs flashed. “You have one.” He slammed his chest with his fist. It was such an Alpha declaration. Primitive. Primal. Entitled.<br />Her traitorous clit throbbed harder.<br /><br />Nikolai is a possessive, arrogant, and outrageous Alpha. Faced with a horrific past he seeks revenge and he wants justice through his enemy's daughter. Barely surviving his childhood his purpose was to take care of his siblings. Now an Alpha of large wealth he waits to take posssession of his omega whom he met when he was a boy. <br /><br />"A ruthless king needs an equally fierce queen by his side."<br /><br />Dahlia's family has never shown her compassion. She expected to be abused and mistreated but not the care her Alpha showers her with. Nikolai is determined to use Dahlia's powers for his own use. He is fearless and is unapologetic about what he wants. When it comes to his omega he doesn't want her to fear him. Their bond is strong, he would do anything to protect his fierce omega. Dahlia's loyalties are challenged, she is willing to sacrifice for her family but what if her loyalties are misplaced. <br /><br />This organized crime mafia Alphaverse world was amazing. I'm bored with the usual Omegaverse ritual but this book hold the 'interesting' word boldly. If you enjoy Omegaverse and you're searching for more to read this series is a must pick up.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/61807606?shelf=2021-favourite-reads" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">2021-favourite-reads</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/61807606?shelf=2021-reading-challenge" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">2021-reading-challenge</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/61807606?shelf=abduction" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">abduction</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">40 likes</spa