uffering. <br /><br />I’m looking forward to reading the rest of the series, and I am wholly optimistic about it. <br /><br /><b>OW/OM DRAMA</b> none<br /><b>CHEATING</b> none — worth mentioning he was intimate with other women after meeting her (when they were both children) but this is due to him being an alpha and having to control aggression<br /><b>THIRD ACT BREAKUP</b> sort of — separate to protect kind of thing<br /><b>ENDING</b> HEA — couple is happy and settled, but threat remains large<br /><br /><b>POV</b> dual / third person<br /><b>SPICE LEVEL</b> 4.5 / 5<br /><b>RATING</b> 4.5 / 5</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=alien" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">alien</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=cuddly-mmc" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">cuddly-mmc</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=fated-mates" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">fated-mates</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">32 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">8 comments</span></button></div></div><di