  <u>14 June 2021 (Re-Read)</u>
</i><br />Reread this awesome book in the preparation for Savage Prince! Omg, It's delight, I can see even more clues now lol😍. This story makes me so emotional still &amp; my heart all Fluttery❤. #MustRead<br /><br /><i>
  <u>4 January 2021 (Read)</u>
</i><br /><b>"Every Ruthless King Needs an Equally Ruthless Queen."</b><br />An Enchanting Start to this Epic series!<br /><b>A Sci-Fi Blockbuster Story with Emotional pasts, Heart-gripping Suspense, Loads of Drama, Betrayal, Action, Secrets, Lies, Hurt, Steamy times, Truth, Happiness, Swoony Love, Laugh-out-loud Fun, Surprising Twists, Kept me on Edge Showdown, A Gorgeous HEA AND I want more!</b><br />This book made me feel all sorts of emotion, I read it till the wee hours of night! I love Nikolai &amp; Dahlia so much, Their Strength inspires me. DEVOURED this story in 8hrs. Once again Alison has shown why she's my fav sci-fi author!<br /><br /><i>This story takes place in Anarcheim, a parallel Alphaverse galaxy, With Varied Alien life. Alphas lead, betas serve, and omegas submit. Where violence is a way of life, power is essential to survival, and crime is king.</i><br />(The world building is so Great!)<br /><br />Nikolai &amp; Dahlia, Both had hard lives. Her as this place is so damn cruel to omegas; Him after Her father killed his dad, took over his planet &amp; made Nik's (&amp; His siblings) life hell.<br />🔥Nikolai Skolov (eldest brother) &amp; Dahlia Lundin met at one fated Night 15 years ago. The night that changed Everything. That forged him on a path of Revenge against her dad, which marked that Nik'll come for her.<br /><br /><b>"The Skolov crime boss might be a ruthless Alpha beast, but he hadn’t been born that way. He’d been made, molded by shame and rage and each horrific brutal thing that had been done to him by her family."</b><br /><br />Now, Her Dad (I hate the guy!) owed Debts, Gave her away as payments to... Nikolai. But Nik isn't her Savior anymore. She's a pawn in his Revenge, BUT she'll become his Salvation.<br /><i>Their Fated mate bond, Her seemingly gone but now Back Omega Power (Past Visions), &amp; Happiness is the key.</i><br />Love will Save them, but for the safety of their family, they can't submit. Them going toe-to-toe is so fun!<br /><br /><b>"He was determined to conquer her mind as well. He wanted her to see him as her master and protector, ruler and champion, defender and disciplinarian."</b><br />When she almost dies, Everything Changes. It Reminds him of the feelings he'd always harboured For her. From that moment on, making her smile mattered the most. <i>He also finds a way so that Her innocent sister won't get caught in his Revenge.</i> His siblings were reluctant, but soon accepted Dahlia!<br /><b>"He was her Alpha and her protector. Her end and her beginning. Her torment and her greatest pleasure."</b><br /><br />Their Happiness had my heart soaring, It was pure &amp; beautiful, They grew closer, &amp; the sexy times were Fiery. Her Visions gave her (&amp; us) an insight to everything Nik endured for his Family's well being. I fell for Nik &amp; Dahlia so hard!<br /><b>"With Dahlia, he was reborn. Freed. Unburdened. He was content. That had to be enough. It was more, in fact, than anyone had ever given him before."</b><br /><br />But Dangers &amp; Attacks are growing.. Only showing the truth of that fated night can save them, Now She even wanted to help him BUT he finds that the truth may hurt her..So he refuses the help he wanted so much earlier.<br /><br /><b>"I don’t see you as a monster anymore. Far from it....I see an Alpha who is brave and selfless and fierce. A fated mate who has brought me joy and laughter, and shown me a power within myself I had no idea existed."</b><br /><br />And When Danger comes too close, He chooses her &amp; their family over vengeance.<br /><b>"His omega was different. She was goodness and light. Too fucking perfect for the likes of him. Yet he loved her with every dark, twisted piece of his soul....The fated-mate bond wasn't a trap. It had set him free."</b><br /><br />The Depth of his feelings broke the last restraint within her. She shows everyone that She's powerful, not Weak as many thought of omegas. Cue Heart-racing Scenes..<br /><b>"He’d considered her needs over his, and rather than using her for his own agenda, as was his initial plan, he’d done the exact opposite. He’d chosen her life over his...He was a true Alpha...He was her leader, her master, her mate, her treasure, and her love."</b><br /><br />And at last, Heart-aching Twist happens &amp; Surprising truths are found. Her vision saves Them all *Happy Tears*. And the True Villain here, who's actually just someone's pawn in the greater schemes, is found! *Fist-pump!*<br /><i>The ending's beautiful, the love, belief &amp; respect Nik has for Dahlia makes me so happy! Now the other crime bosses owe her *Snicker*.</i><br /><br />The epilogue &amp; Bonus Epilogue were Fun, Sexy &amp; Gorgeous! (I loved seeing Nikolai &amp; Dahlia's HEA!)<br />I can't wait for Maxheim's (2nd Skolov brother) story &amp; see where this series takes us, hope to get clues about the Real Mastermind &amp; Their endgame!<br />**<i>ARC Received for a Honest Review.</i>**<br /><a href="https://m.facebook.com/ToonasaLovesBooks/" rel="nofollow noopener">FB Page</a> | <a href="https://www.instagram.com/toonasa.loves.books/" rel="nofollow noopener">Instagram</a> | <a href="https://www.bookbub.com/profile/89245731" rel="nofollow noopener">Bookbub</a> | <a href="https://m.facebook.com/groups/164936121697459/" rel="nofollow noopener">FB group</a></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/81913577?shelf=arc-beauty-2021" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">arc-beauty-2021</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/81913577?shelf=omegaverse_all-types" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">omegaverse_all-types</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/81913577?shelf=sci-fi-tech" class=