them on the streets before becoming a powerful mafia guy himself. <br /><br />The story starts:<br />Her father owes the H lots of $$, but is unable to pay the debt, so he gives the h away in exchange. For 15 yrs, he’s been trying to find a way to get the h because she’s MINE and to avenge his family. So after he collect the h from the evil dad, they have lots of hot nasty sex - the good kind (dub con but she’s in heat like always)…. <br /><br />Or he’s trying to get her to use her omega gift of showing past memories. He needs evidence of her dad murdering some mob guy so he can put him away and her gift is needed but she’s resisting. He wants to help but she has to protect her mom and sister who’s still with her evil dad. <br /><br />So half the book where I DNF, is them having sex and him trying to make her use her gift…so expect lots of annoying AF flashbacks of their past, and you get to learn about all his family members for their future books. <br /><br />I hate flashbacks…<br /><br />The writing is excellent. I’m shocked I never heard of this author but I hated how the story didn’t move, there was not enough angst, drama or something to keep my interest.. I don’t read romance just for sex.<br /><br />4 stars for the writing<br />2 stars for the plot that went no where. <br /><br /><br />Pros<br />Beautiful, strong vulnerable h. <br />Strong, obsessed jealous possessive alpha H, who grew up tortured and abused to protect his family.<br />The authors writing style was just 💕.<br />The smut was hot!🥵<br /><br /><br /><br /><br />🚩Safety<br /><br />This is not going to be helpful since I only read half the book, but he said he thought of her when he was with other omegas while he was away from her. <br /><br />They met when he was 13. Apart for 15 yrs. He knew h was his fated mate at 13, so unlike other mafia guys, he didn’t have a harem.<br /><br />The h was a virgin.<br /><br />Dub con<br /> People said this was dark? Lol I must be so warped because I didn’t find this dark at all.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2466134?shelf=childhood-friends" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">childhood-friends</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2466134?shelf=coming-of-age-romance" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">coming-of-age-romance</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2466134?shelf=enemies-to-lovers" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">enemies-to-lovers</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">19 likes</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708