undefined0small" d="M24 9.63469C24 9.35683 23.7747 9.13158 23.4969 9.13158H15.0892L12.477 1.34327C12.4269 1.19375 12.3095 1.0764 12.16 1.02625C11.8966 0.937894 11.6114 1.07983 11.523 1.34327L8.91088 9.13158H0.503157C0.33975 9.13158 0.186521 9.21094 0.0922364 9.3444C-0.0680877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></defs><use clip-path="url(#clip_RatingStar_undefined0small)" href="#path_RatingStar_undefined0small" class="RatingStar__backgroundFill"></use><path class="RatingStar__fill"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3735107103">January 11, 2021</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">This book and the MCs were super unexpected. I've always been unsure of this genre and was uncertain if this alpha-omega read would be my cup of tea, my worries were for nothing. I found myself getting lost in the world and MCs Aimes had created, finished this thinking bloody hell I want book two.<br /><br />Fated mates, organised crime, revenge, a possessive and dark Alpha male, a fab heroine, and murder and intrigue make this one great ride. <br /><br />I loved Dahlia Lundin - she's a fierce and resilient omega that shows the perceptions of omegas as weak is horribly wrong. Nikolai Skolov is a formidable and uber dominant Alpha, determined to protect his family and make the monster of their childhood pay. Finally getting his hands on his fated mate who happens to be the daughter of his enemy, he has no plans to become an 'Alpha-bitch' consumed by his mate, but what he does not count on is Dahlia, how she makes him feel and what she makes him crave.<br /><br />Going in my re-read pile.<br /><br /><b>Warning/Potential Trigger:</b><input type="checkbox" class="spoiler__control" aria-label="The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide." onchange="this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);" id="2d8177ae-3952-48c7-9ee0-ba3bebebd1fe" /><label aria-hidden="true" class="spoiler" for="2d8177ae-3952-48c7-9ee0-ba3bebebd1fe">Omegas are biologically driven to desire Alphas and have no control over their sexual urges - so issues/questions around consent really pop up at the start, something about how things were depicted led to me not being horrified.</label></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/88350974?shelf=ace-heroine" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">ace-heroine</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/88350974?shelf=alien-romance" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">alien-romance</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/88350974?shelf=mafia-romance" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">mafia-romance</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--