 I would submit and beg in a heartbeat if I had an Alpha like Nikolai. <br /><br />You know those heroes we love that are all jealous and possessive and growly and protective? Yeah, that’s Nikolai. And you guys...he literally growls. <br />All. <br />The. <br />Time. <br />And that makes Dahlia shiver and tingle and swoon...among other things. And you guys...it made ME shiver and tingle and swoon, too. <br /><br />Big ol’ growly, possessive Alpha? <br />YES. PLEASE. <br /><br />And the feels...they were everywhere in this story! Pretty much every page was filled with something that made me feel way deep down inside. With every turn of the page I was feeling one emotion or another...pain or passion or love or heartache or anger or tingles or fear or happiness...there was always something. This story has it all. <br /><br />I could feel the power, I could hear those growls, I could feel that bond. <br /><br />Is there anything hotter than a strong, possessive, protective alpha who is brought to his knees by an omega that he loves with all his heart and would die for?! GEEZ. These two were FIRE. The connection and chemistry and intoxicating passion between them made my Kindle sizzle. <br /><br />I was ready for the dark and gritty. <br />I was ready to devour. <br />But I was not ready for my heart to be stolen. But that’s okay, Nikolai can have it. <br /><br />I absolutely loved this fabulously written Sci-Fi romance with tons of dark and delicious alpha goodness. <br /><br />It was intense. <br />It was intoxicating.<br />It was scorching and sexy and utterly filthy. <br />It was UNPUTDOWNABLE. <br />And the best part? It rocked my fucking socks off. I love when that happens.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Butt