: I’m so glad I stuck with this book because Dahlia’s agency and power was dealt with in a satisfying way, and Nikolai stayed ruthless throughout the book but towards the end there was no doubt that he put her first.<br /><br />Loved this so much. Can’t wait to read the next book!<br /><br />------------<br /><br />Re-listen on 7 May 2026 - just as good as the first time! I’m glad I didn’t put a bunch of spoilers in my review, because I’d forgotten a lot of the details and could go on the journey again. What a ride. It’s also totally daddy kink coded, even if that’s never explicitly mentioned in the book. 😏</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/17871000?shelf=audio-library" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">audio-library</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/17871000?shelf=audiobook-available" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">audiobook-available</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/17871000?shelf=audiobook-duet" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">audiobook-duet</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">12 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__la