x="0 0 24 24" role="presentation"><path class="RatingStar__fill" d="M24 9.63469C24 9.35683 23.7747 9.13158 23.4969 9.13158H15.0892L12.477 1.34327C12.4269 1.19375 12.3095 1.0764 12.16 1.02625C11.8966 0.937894 11.6114 1.07983 11.523 1.34327L8.91088 9.13158H0.503157C0.33975 9.13158 0.186521 9.21094 0.0922364 9.3444C-0.0680877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3661254115">February 17, 2021</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">OMG! This Book Will Burn You! <br><br>The first thing you have to do is to put aside your thoughts that these creatures are human. They are not. They are alien and primal beasts. They function on pure animal instict with all the trappings of a civilization but violent, territorial, and sexual. <br><br>There world is ice and cold and brutal... as are the males<br><br><img src="https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1613534764i/30880257._SX540_.jpg" height="100" alt="description" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br><br>The Alphas are cruel, vicious, mean, violent, aggressive, and possessive, and very Ruthless. This is Nikolai Skolov. <br><br> <img src="https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1613534352i/30880254._SY540_.jpg" width="140" height="140" alt="description" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br><br>And his newest possession is Dalhia Lundin. The daughter of his greatest enemy. She is his obsession. <br><br> <img src="https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1613534585i/30880256._SY540_.jpg" width="140" height="140" alt="description" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"><br><br>The Omega’s are born to bend to the will of the Alpha. They have no power to resist the call to submit and give their body to their Alpha. They are born to serve, to be knotted, to be bred. That is their lot in life. <br><br>Wow! That is a lot to process. And to wrap your mind around. I’m pretty stubborn. I have a mind of my own. I don’t like to be bossed around. At the same time, I can relate to Dalhia. It’s all instinctual. It’s chemical and sexual. And you are helpless. <br><br>I went in certain that I was going to hate the hero, Nikolai Skolov . But... He’s complicated. He’s shaped by all that he has lived through. He’s made himself Alpha for his family. For his woman. For his people. I thought I would really dislike him. But I fell in love with him. How could I resist? He is Alpha. He is everything. He has a tender heart. He has a soul that has been hurt, and beaten, and left alone for too long. He is wonderful. <br><br>Dalhia is kindhearted and sweet and good. Too good for the violent world she lives in. Too good for the violent man who would own her heart and her soul. She is naive and trusting of family that would use her for their own goals. She fell in love long ago with a handsome boy who needed her help. She never stopped loving him. She is stronger than she knows. She has steel in her soul. She can endure for the ones she loves. Her love finally sets Nikolai free. She calms him, sooths him, excites him, and submits to his every command. <br><br>This book will make your panties melt! This book is scorching. This book makes me obsessive about the characters and the world and I want more! <br><br> <br><br>Alison Aimes sends her readers into a hot, sexy, new world... and I want more! <br><br> <img src="https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1603817493i/30296592.png" width="145" height="115" alt="description" class="gr-hostedUserImg" loading="lazy"></span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=abduction" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">abduction</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=abused-heroine" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">abused-heroine</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=alien-hero" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">alien-hero</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">11 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">4 comments</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.9