6 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5827148780">March 8, 2024</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">to quote the author, my reading experience was <b>“indescribable pleasure and unbearable shame”</b> <br /><br />🛸🪢🧊🔺<br /><br /><b>She</b> is prime omega with an awful father and a forgotten Omega gift. <b>He</b> is the enemy Alpha &amp; the crime boss of the Skolov syndicate. Nikolai and Dahlia embark on a tumultuous path of self discovery, betrayal and of course <i>plenty of knots</i> 🪢 extra spicy fated mates!!<br /><br /><u>Nikolai</u><br />-eldest of 7 siblings<br />-leader &amp; Alpha crime boss leader<br />-looking for his childhood sweetheart 💕 <br />-emotionally intelligent &amp; available (<b>AMEN!!</b>)<br />-fiercely protective<br />-has a knot!<br /><br /><u>Dahlia</u><br />-gifted Omega with special powers<br />-imprisoned by daddy dearest!<br />-recently acquired a fated mate <br />-super loyal!<br /><br />✨🪐💖🚀<br /><br /><b>THIS IS THE YEAR OF OMEGAVERSE AND I’M LOVING IT!</b> I was absolutely FEENKING for the premise of this book. <u>Omega’s special gifts only manifest if she finds her Alpha mate but in order for Alphas to use the gifts the Omega must like him.</u> 💖 The only way to power omega’s gift is through her happiness and contentment!! ✨ so in this one Alphas have to know how to make their mates happy AND SATISFIED!! <br /><br /><b>”I’m going to fuck you so hard I leave an imprint on your soul. One that will make it impossible for you to simply throw yourself away without thinking of me.”</b><br /><br />🚨<u>My new fav trope:</u> barely leashed Alpha crime boss trying his hardest to make his omega happy<br /><br /><b>“What I feel for you is timeless. Vast. Infinite. It is past, present, and future. It is need and rage and pain and lust. It is every dirty sin, every ruthless act, every brief flicker of goodness and light in me. It is all for you. It has always been for you.”</b> i mean how can i not die reading this 💀 <br /><br />I mean spice is off the charts BUT THE PLOT is great too! Very unpredictable and makes me want to immediately pick up the next book in the series.<br /><br /><br />omegaverse<br />forced proximity 👯<br />sweet but terrifying mmc <br />body betrayal <br />virgin fmc<br />dub con encounters <br />fated mates ✨ <br />found family <br />HEA</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/147664566?shelf=alien-stuff" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">alien-stuff</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/147664566?shelf=boy-obsessed" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">boy-obsessed</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/147664566?shelf=enemies-to-lovers" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">enemies-to-lovers</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">11 likes