ss="RatingStar__fill"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3729568316">January 2, 2021</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">A great start to the series!!! Nikolai and Dahlia's story was more than Alpha and Omega!<br />******<br />Rating: 4 Stars<br />Steam: 4 flames<br />Genre: Sci-fi / Alien / Omegaverse / Fated Mates<br />******<br />Nikolai, the Ruthless King, Alpha. He has suffered and sacrificed for years to protect his family and get to where he is now. There is only one thing missing. Taking the Omega daughter from the man that ruined his childhood.<br /><br />Dahlia, sassy, strong, Omega. She has suffered at the hands of her Prime Omega mother and Alpha Father. Her father has lost some wagers and in order to pay his debt, he is giving Dahlia to his debt holder. Is it worse to be at home and confined to the house and treated like dirt or given away to an unknown Alpha...or is he unknown? <br /><br />This book was filled with betrayal, deceit, darkness, danger, and determination. Both Nikolai and Dahlia are trying to protect themselves, but should they be protecting themselves from each other, or are their outside influences that are much more dangerous. <br /><br />There were twists, turns, steam, intrigue, romance, and growth between the two characters. These two definitely grew! Ruthless King had a fantastic story that kept me engaged well into the night. I read this in one sitting because I was so enthralled I couldn't put it down. I just knew there was something going on, but just couldn't put my finger on it. It was suspenseful and did I mention steamy? <br /><br />As one of the only Omegaverse books I have ever read, and only my second book by Alison Aimes I was pleased with the writing, story, characters, and I am a sucker for fated mates. I will definitely keep reading this series. Also, DO NOT FORGOT TO DOWNLOAD THE BONUS EPILOGUE it will give you insight into the next book and it was great! I look forward to more Ruthless Warlords and can't wait for book 2!<br /><br />This gets a big thumbs up recommendation from me!</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=2020-books" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">2020-books</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=aliens" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">aliens</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=anti-hero" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">anti-hero</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">7 likes</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607