f 2020 and my favorite Alison Aimes book by far. It made me smile, bawl my eyes out, wet my panties, growl in anger, and howl in grief. This book clamped me into an emotional rollercoaster car, set the damn thing to "f**k her up", and hit the GO button. Nikolai stole my heart, Dahlia stole my soul, and this first book in the Ruthless Warlords series stole my money for the next few years--take it! Take my money!<br /><br />That said I LIVE for this book. Gimme more, Alison!</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/57380683?shelf=alpha-protector" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">alpha-protector</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/57380683?shelf=arc" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">arc</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/57380683?shelf=best-ever" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">best-ever</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</span></button></div></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">7 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">1 comment</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Bu