typename":"User","legacyId":39243185,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1714028563i/39243185._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1422,"textReviewsCount":2713,"name":"Natalie  ~ The Biblioholic","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/39243185-natalie-the-biblioholic","contributor":null,"id":39243185},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AOBOV56WXMZO7":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AOBOV56WXMZO7"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AOBOV56WXMZO7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AOBOV56WXMZO7","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AOBOV56WXMZO7"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/39243185?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"dual-pov","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/39243185?shelf=dual-pov"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"mafia","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/39243185?shelf=mafia"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"sci-fi","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/39243185?shelf=sci-fi"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3759683540"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.DxEEusW1pLXLFq4rZWipZA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.DxEEusW1pLXLFq4rZWipZA","creator":{"__ref":"User:39243185"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1731344374584,"createdAt":1610221313710,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1610376541018,"text":"I have never read from Alison Aimes before, but after reading \u003cb\u003eRuthless King\u003c/b\u003e, I'm definitely adding her to my must-read list!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHere are the reasons why you should read this and why it got five stars...\u003cbr\u003e❤️ fated mates\u003cbr\u003e❤️ organized crime shenanigans\u003cbr\u003e❤️ fierce warrior who was insanely hot\u003cbr\u003e❤️ strong and stubborn omega who tried to give as good as she got\u003cbr\u003e❤️ revenge plot\u003cbr\u003e❤️ brilliant storytelling and incredible world building. I could feel the cold of ice planet Abzal.\u003cbr\u003e❤️ tons of hot sex. \u003cb\u003eTONS!!\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e❤️ enemies-to-lovers trope that blossomed into something truly beautiful\u003cbr\u003e❤️ redeemable characters and huge hints to what's to come...\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNikolai Skolov is an Alpha - dominant, fearless, gorgeous - and he was the glue that held the Skolovs together. A horror from the past has gone unavenged and unanswered, and now's the time for justice. For truth. And Dahlia Lundin, daughter of his greatest enemy, is the key. Traded to pay her father's debts, she expects abuse, unkindness, and unending punishment. Nikolai wants to use her gift to make her family pay. She is willing to sacrifice anything to keep her family safe. They're at odds until she realizes she's fighting the wrong thing and the wrong person.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003cb\u003eEvery filthy, arrogant pronouncement only made her wetter.\u003cbr\u003e She fought it as best she could.\u003cbr\u003e \"This isn't me. You're triggering my heat. You're using my weakness against me.\"\u003cbr\u003e \"Weakness? It's not some flaw inside you. It's \u003ci\u003eall\u003c/i\u003e you are, omega. This is what you were made for. Your body knows exactly what it was designed to do. Give.\"\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhile she grew up treated as trash, Nikolai treated her as his treasure. They were supposed to be on opposite sides, enemies, but with his every move, every thought, every touch, Nikolai proved to Dahlia that everything she knew was wrong. And she gave him the most ultimate prize - her heart. With her, he found all that he was missing.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003cb\u003eWith Dahlia, he was reborn.\u003cbr\u003e Freed.\u003cbr\u003e Unburdened.\u003cbr\u003e He was content.\u003cbr\u003e It was more, in fact, than anyone had ever given him before.\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI fell in love with these characters so easily. I loved when they fought, I loved when they bantered, and I loved when they loved. Most of the bad guys got just what they deserved, the good guys kinda won, and I'm looking forward to the next hunt.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.nbiblioholic.com/2021/01/ruthless-king-by-alison-aimes-arc-review.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003e\n  \u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1610376541i/30679057._SX540_.jpg\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\n\u003c/a\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AOBOV56WXMZO7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}"},"likeCount":42,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":2},"User:9460945":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":9460945,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1685923274i/9460945._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1623,"textReviewsCount":2637,"name":"Bex (Beckie Bookworm)","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/9460945-bex-beckie-bookworm","contributor":null,"id":9460945},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2YN73LS21CI1A":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2YN73LS21CI1A"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2YN73LS21CI1A\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2YN73LS21CI1A","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2YN73LS21CI1A"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9460945?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"aliens-creature-monster-non-human","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9460945?shelf=aliens-creature-monster-non-human"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"arc","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9460945?shelf=arc"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"book-reviews","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9460945?shelf=book-reviews"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"dark","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9460945?shelf=dark"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"enemies-to-lovers","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9460945?shelf=enemies-to-lovers"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fated-mates","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9460945?shelf=fated-mates"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"spicy","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9460945?shelf=spicy"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"human-breeds","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9460945?shelf=human-breeds"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"mafia-mobster-organised-crime","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9460945?shelf=mafia-mobster-organised-crime"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"omegaverse","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/9460945?shelf=omegaverse"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3726192326"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.E8MF5p9SVi8wbCXBUAeL4w":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.E8MF5p9SVi8wbCXBUAeL4w","creator":{"__ref":"User:9460945"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1731344388137,"createdAt":1609355253608,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1611188497918,"text":"\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1598989163i/30047654.jpg\" alt=\"Untitled design-High-Quality\" width=\"686\" height=\"88\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1598991425i/30047740.gif\" alt=\"My Review\" width=\"468\" height=\"60\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOh wow this was so good I’m blown away with how much I enjoyed this and I couldn’t put it down I was that invested.\u003cbr\u003eThis is a new series for this author set in the Anarcheim universe it’s a brutal hierarchy of Alpha Betas and Omegas and the Alphas rule it all with an iron fist.\u003cbr\u003eThis one is such a genre mash-up which I adored the Brotherhood which rules this universe is made up of various crime syndicates and this is a combination of Darkness, Sci-Fi, Mafia and omegaverse all rolled into one.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Omega here Dahlia is the daughter of Olan Lundin he is the head of the Lundin syndicate.\u003cbr\u003eBecause of prior events, the Lundin’s and Skolov’s are at war and The Ruthless king, Nikolai Skolov and head of the Skolov syndicate is gunning for the whole Lundin clan and the key to there total annihilation may just lie with one little Omega one who also just happens to be Nikolai’s fated mate. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDahlia finds herself being used as collateral to pay a debt owed from her father to her mate and being redefined as his property.\u003cbr\u003eBut her alpha also has plans to unlock and access her special gift one that has lain dormant for years.\u003cbr\u003eThis one definitely had a dark vein running through it but being omegaverse it also was easier to accept.\u003cbr\u003eThe connection between Alpha and Omega was intense and sizzled off the page and this one was scorching hot in temperature.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis is essentially an enemy to lovers trope with the lover's bit, because of the alpha and omega dynamic happening fairly swiftly.\u003cbr\u003eBut though her alpha may have her body she still tries to stay strong against his magnetic allure.\u003cbr\u003eNikolai himself is quite brutal and crude but this a lot is due to his past and just what he has had to overcome to keep his family safe.\u003cbr\u003eHe’s not always that nice to Dahlia initially in his actions and words and this instantly sets them up as adversaries.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003einitially, he tries to fight his new emotional bonds believing them a weakness he can’t afford but at the same time he also craves the closeness and connection, it doesn’t come naturally to him being so vulnerable to another and he initially fights his feelings.\u003cbr\u003eBy contrast, Dahlia is much softer her gentler nature offsetting her mates.\u003cbr\u003eBut this softness doesn’t affect her strength and Dahlia has a core of steel when it comes to protecting those she cares about.\u003cbr\u003eShe may be an omega in dynamic but she doesn’t allow this to define her character and refuses to be cowed and defeated.\u003cbr\u003eEven going as far as to make desperate choices that will only open her Alphas eyes further regarding her true worth to him.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis had some fabulous world-building and great secondary characters.\u003cbr\u003eIt’s very well written and this author's books just keep on getting better I’m seriously impressed.\u003cbr\u003eI can’t wait to read more set in this fascinating new world and will definitely be picking up the next book in this series this really was fabulous and I highly recommend.\u003cbr\u003eI voluntary reviewed a copy of Ruthless King (Ruthless Warlords #1).\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1598991966i/30047768.gif\" alt=\"Untitled design\" width=\"686\" height=\"88\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eReviewed By Beckie Bookworm\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/beckiebookworm/\"\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/beckiebookworm/\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"http://www.beckiebookworm.com\"\u003ewww.beckiebookworm.com\u003c/a\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2YN73LS21CI1A\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}"},"likeCount":38,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":9},"User:61807606":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":61807606,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1662379434i/61807606._UX200_CR0,38,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":302,"textReviewsCount":457,"name":"Birjis","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/61807606-birjis","contributor":null,"id":61807606},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1MS6499LE0BDE":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1MS6499LE0BDE"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1MS6499LE0BDE\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1MS6499LE0BDE","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1MS6499LE0BDE"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/61807606?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"2021-favourite-reads","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/61807606?shelf=2021-favourite-reads"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"2021-reading-challenge","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/61807606?shelf=2021-reading-challenge"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"abduction","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/61807606?shelf=abduction"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"alien-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/61807606?shelf=alien-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"captive","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/61807606?shelf=captive"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"dark-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/61807606?shelf=dark-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"omegaverse","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/61807606?shelf=omegaverse"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"review","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/61807606?shelf=review"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"sci-fi-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/61807606?shelf=sci-fi-romance"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3859761399"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.TzuxediK4j0f3Vkv3iX_wQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.TzuxediK4j0f3Vkv3iX_wQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:61807606"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1722190199297,"createdAt":1614286499723,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1614286641785,"text":"Thank you Meredith for encouraging me to read this Omegaverse. I saw this book and turned a blind eye but I'm glad you brought this book to my attention again. 💜\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eA wonderful Omegaverse mash with aliens plus a fat dose of mafia genre, so different and interesting. \u003cbr /\u003eSet in a parallel Alphaverse universe, Anarcheim is a galaxy seeded with different alien species. The inhabitants - Alphas who lead, Beta's serve and Omega's submit. In this dark, currupted place among the many galaxies only the strong survives. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnother low growl erupted as he skimmed his lips along the curve of her shoulder. “I’ve wanted you like this since I first saw you.”\u003cbr /\u003eAnother shiver. More slick pearled on her folds. “I was a child.”\u003cbr /\u003e“I never was.” His every dominant gesture only triggered her heat higher. “And thank fuck, you’re not any longer.”\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e15-years later 24-year-old Dahlia Lundin and 28-year-old Nikolai Skolov meet again this time with different intentions. Nikolai seeks revenge from Dahlia's father and he needs something from her that would make her betray her family. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHis growl shifted to a purr. “My property. My prize. Your bastard of a father sold you to me to pay for his sins—and I intend to collect.”\u003cbr /\u003e“I’m not just some rut toy.”\u003cbr /\u003e“You’re whatever I want you to be.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDahlia is an Omega, unfortunate, for she was a mere pawn to bargain against odds and of a power society by her father. A large debt has her father sold her which brings her face to face to a man she once met as a little girl. Having never forgotten him she unexpectantly realises that this Alpha is no more the little boy. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"Wait.” Her heart slammed in her throat. “I . . . I need a weapon.” It was worth a try.\u003cbr /\u003eHis fangs flashed. “You have one.” He slammed his chest with his fist. It was such an Alpha declaration. Primitive. Primal. Entitled.\u003cbr /\u003eHer traitorous clit throbbed harder.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNikolai is a possessive, arrogant, and outrageous Alpha. Faced with a horrific past he seeks revenge and he wants justice through his enemy's daughter. Barely surviving his childhood his purpose was to take care of his siblings. Now an Alpha of large wealth he waits to take posssession of his omega whom he met when he was a boy. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"A ruthless king needs an equally fierce queen by his side.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDahlia's family has never shown her compassion. She expected to be abused and mistreated but not the care her Alpha showers her with. Nikolai is determined to use Dahlia's powers for his own use. He is fearless and is unapologetic about what he wants. When it comes to his omega he doesn't want her to fear him. Their bond is strong, he would do anything to protect his fierce omega. Dahlia's loyalties are challenged, she is willing to sacrifice for her family but what if her loyalties are misplaced. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis organized crime mafia Alphaverse world was amazing. I'm bored with the usual Omegaverse ritual but this book hold the 'interesting' word boldly. If you enjoy Omegaverse and you're searching for more to read this series is a must pick up.","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1MS6499LE0BDE\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}"},"likeCount":40,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":20},"User:93580497":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":93580497,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images