edimages/1610782388ra/30705813.gif\" alt=\"Worthy GIFs - Get the best GIF on GIPHY\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSo this is my Omegaverse solid gold or kryptonite, however you want to look at it, I love a strong, ruthless, ALPHA who has a sweet side for his omega. Who will tear the world apart and bathe in it's blood for his omega. And slaps her ass and knots her good too. Nikolai was that and more. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSo this is Nikolai in my head:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1610782388i/30705814._SX540_.jpg\" alt=\"LEGEND \" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eand this is Dahlia:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1610782388i/30705815._SX540_.jpg\" alt=\"12+ Anime Angel Female White Hair | Female elf, Elf art, Elf hair\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eand when they're together:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1496600477ra/22932271.gif\" alt=\"Fireworks GIFs - Get the best GIF on GIPHY\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1610782388ra/30705816.gif\" alt=\"Fire Slow GIF - Fire Slow Motion - Discover \u0026amp; Share GIFs\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1610782693ra/30705822.gif\" alt=\"choking couple sub - Album on Imgur\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eand that's all I have to say about that except I can't freakin wait for the next one!!!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A25ZR619C803K7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}"},"likeCount":33,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":19},"User:145247010":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":145247010,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1685036903i/145247010._UY200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":570,"textReviewsCount":265,"name":"readabookonce","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/145247010-readabookonce","contributor":null,"id":145247010},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.MQ1X-qLSE3uq-oEF\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.MQ1X-qLSE3uq-oEF","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.MQ1X-qLSE3uq-oEF"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"alien","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=alien"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"cuddly-mmc","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=cuddly-mmc"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"fated-mates","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=fated-mates"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"mafia","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=mafia"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"revenge","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/145247010?shelf=revenge"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5443239559"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.pvUtK9Eb_mTZzs_SKqrG0g":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.pvUtK9Eb_mTZzs_SKqrG0g","creator":{"__ref":"User:145247010"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1737178077778,"createdAt":1689725680785,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1689725701586,"text":"Combining my two favorite subgenres—alien and mafia romance—has forever altered my mind. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eMAIN CHARACTER NAMES AND AGES\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDahlia Skolov née Lundin (24) \u003cb\u003e|\u003c/b\u003e Nikolai Skolov (28)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eFEATURES\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e∘ alien romance\u003cbr /\u003e∘ omegaverse\u003cbr /\u003e∘ revenge (enemy’s daughter)\u003cbr /\u003e∘ sold as payment of debt\u003cbr /\u003e∘ fated mates\u003cbr /\u003e∘ matebond where they can feel each other’s emotions and presence\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eREVIEW\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI devoured this novel. A revenge plot and fated mates is just too powerful of a combination. It’s always going to be a hit for me. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI fully sympathized with both Dahlia and Nikolai. Both had had very different but equally hard lives. I adored when they first met, especially how she was his anchor through his suffering. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI’m looking forward to reading the rest of the series, and I am wholly optimistic about it. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eOW/OM DRAMA\u003c/b\u003e none\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eCHEATING\u003c/b\u003e none — worth mentioning he was intimate with other women after meeting her (when they were both children) but this is due to him being an alpha and having to control aggression\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eTHIRD ACT BREAKUP\u003c/b\u003e sort of — separate to protect kind of thing\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eENDING\u003c/b\u003e HEA — couple is happy and settled, but threat remains large\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003ePOV\u003c/b\u003e dual / third person\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eSPICE LEVEL\u003c/b\u003e 4.5 / 5\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eRATING\u003c/b\u003e 4.5 / 5","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1B1XSF89XO4EM\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.MQ1X-qLSE3uq-oEF\"}}"},"likeCount":32,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":8},"User:4930778":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":4930778,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1612806359i/4930778._UY200_CR28,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1533,"textReviewsCount":1824,"name":"Lady Raven RAVE!","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/4930778-lady-raven-rave","contributor":null,"id":4930778},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2TW6P2SU15L68":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2TW6P2SU15L68"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2TW6P2SU15L68\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2TW6P2SU15L68","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2TW6P2SU15L68"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/4930778?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"dark-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/4930778?shelf=dark-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"dark-mix-genre-rom","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/4930778?shelf=dark-mix-genre-rom"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"erotica-sci-fi","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/4930778?shelf=erotica-sci-fi"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"mafia-like","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/4930778?shelf=mafia-like"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal-fantasy-rom","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/4930778?shelf=paranormal-fantasy-rom"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/4930778?shelf=paranormal-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"sci-fi-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/4930778?shelf=sci-fi-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"series-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/4930778?shelf=series-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"virgin-heroine","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/4930778?shelf=virgin-heroine"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"sex-4-stars","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/4930778?shelf=sex-4-stars"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4273191491"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.2jDrG84v6jLcnuR0VunEPw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.2jDrG84v6jLcnuR0VunEPw","creator":{"__ref":"User:4930778"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1731344463581,"createdAt":1633444395900,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1633444541039,"text":"4⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eStyle: Dark Mafia Romance (Sci-Fi)\u003cbr /\u003eStory: 4/5\u003cbr /\u003eEnjoyment: 4/5\u003cbr /\u003eDark Level: 1.5/5 \u003cbr /\u003eSexual Level: SEX-CITINGLY GOOD\u003cbr /\u003eTriggers: No\u003cbr /\u003eViolence: Yes\u003cbr /\u003eMale: Intense, Sexy and Alpha\u003cbr /\u003eSeries: book 1\u003cbr /\u003ePages: 380\u003cbr /\u003eAudio: GOOD(m/f)\u003cbr /\u003eKindle Unlimited: No\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSTORY:\u003cbr /\u003eI have read Omegaverse books, but I didn’t know what to expect from an Omegaverse Mafia Romance. I really liked this one and the blurb was eye catching as well. You have the story between Nikolai and Dahlia, and the story of what Nikolai is trying to uncover with his family and their past. This was a payment debt/mated theme, and it held true to that. Nikolai, was very Alpha in this book. Intense and at times, and soft when he needed to be, but not in a way that is off putting. Nikolai came from nothing, so his ruthlessness is born from that. Dahlia was a very likable character. She doesn’t have the best relationship with her father, however, he uses her to get what he needs. I liked that Dahlia had special powers, and it evolved as her character evolved. This was dark, but it wasn’t hardcore dark.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI really love the male actor who does Nikolai’s voice. I think that's a big part of why I love this. He brought his character to life for me. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSEXUAL CHEMISTRY:\u003cbr /\u003eSex scenes were good for my liking. In Omegaverse, I always find it appealing when betas can’t control their needs to their mated Alphas. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSECONDARY CHARACTERS:\u003cbr /\u003eDahlia’s family, mmmmm the nicest way to describe them, crazy. However, Nikolai’s family love them. Maxheim sexy. Hopefully I get to read his story soon. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOVERALL:\u003cbr /\u003eI love the characters and I really enjoyed the plot of the story. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTRIGGERS: violence\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e****I don’t equate these stories to real life. It’s about personal taste and what you would or want to tolerate with the books you read. I know we all have different opinions and preferences with what we read. I based my book reviews on my preferences and what I like, and while these preferences may not be the same for others, I hope this review was still helpful. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e ","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2TW6P2SU15L68\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}"},"likeCount":29,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":1},"User:81913577":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":81913577,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1666010092i/81913577._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":325,"textReviewsCount":1755,"name":"⭐Toonasa⭐ *Romance Book Lovers' Haven* (For long and deep.... reviews!)","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/81913577-toonasa-romance-book-lovers-haven-for-long-and-deep-reviews","contributor":null,"id":81913577},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3JLDEK2WKLYKW":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3JLDEK2WKLYKW"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3JLDEK2WKLYKW\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3JLDEK2WKLYKW","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3JLDEK2WKLYKW"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/81913577?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"arc-beauty-2021","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/81913577?shelf=arc-beauty-2021"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"omegaverse_all-types","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/81913577?shelf=omegaverse_all-types"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"sci-fi-tech","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/81913577?shelf=sci-fi-tech"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3741791597"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.I_rvQTcrzbB4PfPJxXnelA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.I_rvQTcrzbB4PfPJxXnelA","creator":{"__ref":"User:81913577"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1623989246618,"createdAt":1609781780342,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1623729856669,"text":"\u003ci\u003e\n  \u003cu\u003e14 June 2021 (Re-Read)\u003c/u\u003e\n\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eReread this awesome book in the preparation for Savage Prince! Omg, It's delight, I can see even more clues now lol😍. This story makes me so emotional still \u0026amp; my heart all Fluttery❤. #MustRead\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003e\n  \u003cu\u003e4 January 2021 (Read)\u003c/u\u003e\n\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\"Every Ruthless King Needs an Equally Ruthless Queen.\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAn Enchanting Start to this Epic series!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eA Sci-Fi Blockbuster Story with Emotional pasts, Heart-gripping Suspense, Loads of Drama, Betrayal, Action, Secrets, Lies, Hurt, Steamy times, Truth, Happiness, Swoony Love, Laugh-out-loud Fun, Surprising Twists, Kept me on Edge Showdown, A Gorgeous HEA AND I want more!\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis book made me feel all sorts of emotion, I read it till the wee hours of night! I love Nikolai \u0026amp; Dahlia so much, Their Strength inspires me. DEVOURED this story in 8hrs. Once again Alison has shown why she's my fav sci-fi author!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003eThis story takes place in Anarcheim, a parallel Alphaverse galaxy, With Varied Alien life. Alphas lead, betas serve, and omegas submit. Where violence is a way of life, power is essential to survival, and crime is king.\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e(The world building is so Great!)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNikolai \u0026amp; Dahlia, Both had hard lives. Her as this place is so damn cruel to omegas; Him after Her father killed his dad, took over his planet \u0026amp; made Nik's (\u0026amp; His siblings) life hell.\u003cbr /\u003e🔥Nikolai Skolov (eldest brother) \u0026amp; Dahlia Lundin met at one fated Night 15 years ago. The night that changed Everything. That forged him on a path of Revenge against her dad, which marked that Nik'll come for her.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\"The Skolov crime boss might be a ruthless Alpha beast, but he hadn’t been born that way. He’d been made, molded by shame and rage and each horrific brutal thing that had been done to him by her family.\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNow, Her Dad (I hate the guy!) owed Debts, Gave her away as payments to... Nikolai. But Nik isn't her Savior anymore. She's a pawn in his Revenge, BUT she'll become his Salvation.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003eTheir Fated mate bond, Her seemingly gone but now Back Omega Power (Past Visions), \u0026amp; Happiness is the key.\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLove will Save them, but for the safety of their family, they can't submit. Them going toe-to-toe is so fun!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\"He was determined to conquer her mind as well. He wanted her to see him as her master and protector, ruler and champion, defender and disciplinarian.\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhen she almost dies, Everything Changes. It Reminds him of the feelings he'd always harboured For her. From that moment on, making her smile mattered the most. \u003ci\u003eHe also finds a way so that Her innocent sister won't get caught in his Revenge.\u003c/i\u003e His siblings were reluctant, but soon accepted Dahlia!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\"He was her Alpha and her protector. Her end and her beginning. Her torment and her greatest pleasure.\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTheir Happiness had my heart soaring, It was pure \u0026amp; beautiful, They grew closer, \u0026amp; the sexy times were Fiery. Her Visions gave her (\u0026amp; us) an insight to everything Nik endured for his Family's well being. I fell for Nik \u0026amp; Dahlia so hard!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\"With Dahlia, he was reborn. Freed. Unburdened. He was content. That had to be enough. It was more, in fact, than anyone had ever given him before.\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBut Dangers \u0026amp; Attacks are growing.. Only showing the truth of that fated night can save them, Now She even wanted to help him BUT he finds that the truth may hurt her..So he refuses the help he wanted so much earlier.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\"I don’t see you as a monster anymore. Far from it....I see an Alpha who is brave and selfless and fierce. A fated mate who has brought me joy and laughter, and shown me a power within myself I had no idea existed.\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnd When Danger comes too close, He chooses her \u0026amp; their family over vengeance.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\"His omega was different. She was goodness and light. Too fucking perfect for the likes of him. Yet he loved her with every dark, twisted piece of his soul....The fated-mate bond wasn't a trap. It had set him free.\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe Depth of his feelings broke the last restraint within her. She shows everyone that She's powerful, not Weak as many thought of omegas. Cue Heart-racing Scenes..\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\"He’d considered her needs over his, and rather than using her for his own agenda, as was his initial plan, he’d done the exact opposite. He’d chosen her life over his...He was a true Alpha...He was her leader, her master, her mate, her treasure, and her love.\"\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnd at last, Heart-aching Twist happens \u0026amp; Surprising truths are found. Her vision saves Them all *Happy Tears*. And the True Villain here, who's actually just someone's pawn in the greater schemes, is found! *Fist-pump!*\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003eThe ending's beautiful, the love, belief \u0026amp; respect Nik has for Dahlia makes me so happy! Now the other crime bosses owe her *Snicker*.\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe epilogue \u0026amp; Bonus Epilogue were Fun, Sexy \u0026amp; Gorgeous! (I loved seeing Nikolai \u0026amp; Dahlia's HEA!)\u003cbr /\u003eI can't wait for Maxheim's (2nd Skolov brother) story \u0026amp; see where this series takes us, hope to get clues about the Real Mastermind \u0026amp; Their endgame!\u003cbr /\u003e**\u003ci\u003eARC Received for a Honest Review.\u003c/i\u003e**\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://m.facebook.com/ToonasaLovesBooks/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eFB Page\u003c/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"https://www.instagram.com/toonasa.loves.books/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"https://www.bookbub.com/profile/89245731\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eBookbub\u003c/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"https://m.facebook.com/groups/164936121697459/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"\u003eFB group\u003c/a\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3JLDEK2WKLYKW\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}"},"likeCount":26,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":6},"User:70316517":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":70316517,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1570843185i/70316517.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":2764,"textReviewsCount":3284,"name":"Ꮗ€♫◗☿ ❤️ ilikebooksbest.com ❤️","webUrl":"ht