d author who can actually write, steamy AF smut scenes, hot dirty talk and I thought this would be a solid 4/5 stars book. I was wrong…I got bored because the plot went no where after an amazing start. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSpoilers \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHer father is a powerful mafia boss, and he’s pure evil. He’s holding her sister and mom hostage to keep the h in line.\u003cbr /\u003eWhen the H was 13, her dad came to his planet and killed his father, then took his wife for his mistress and ends up killing her and 2 of the H siblings few months later. \u003cbr /\u003eThe H after seeing his twin sibs dead in their crib, took the rest of his brothers and sisters and raised them on the streets before becoming a powerful mafia guy himself. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe story starts:\u003cbr /\u003eHer father owes the H lots of $$, but is unable to pay the debt, so he gives the h away in exchange. For 15 yrs, he’s been trying to find a way to get the h because she’s MINE and to avenge his family. So after he collect the h from the evil dad, they have lots of hot nasty sex - the good kind (dub con but she’s in heat like always)…. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOr he’s trying to get her to use her omega gift of showing past memories. He needs evidence of her dad murdering some mob guy so he can put him away and her gift is needed but she’s resisting. He wants to help but she has to protect her mom and sister who’s still with her evil dad. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSo half the book where I DNF, is them having sex and him trying to make her use her gift…so expect lots of annoying AF flashbacks of their past, and you get to learn about all his family members for their future books. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI hate flashbacks…\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe writing is excellent. I’m shocked I never heard of this author but I hated how the story didn’t move, there was not enough angst, drama or something to keep my interest.. I don’t read romance just for sex.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e4 stars for the writing\u003cbr /\u003e2 stars for the plot that went no where. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003ePros\u003cbr /\u003eBeautiful, strong vulnerable h. \u003cbr /\u003eStrong, obsessed jealous possessive alpha H, who grew up tortured and abused to protect his family.\u003cbr /\u003eThe authors writing style was just 💕.\u003cbr /\u003eThe smut was hot!🥵\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e🚩Safety\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis is not going to be helpful since I only read half the book, but he said he thought of her when he was with other omegas while he was away from her. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThey met when he was 13. Apart for 15 yrs. He knew h was his fated mate at 13, so unlike other mafia guys, he didn’t have a harem.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe h was a virgin.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDub con\u003cbr /\u003e People said this was dark? Lol I must be so warped because I didn’t find this dark at all.","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2CM94AP66CZUP\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}"},"likeCount":19,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:2846645":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":2846645,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1699564865i/2846645._UY200_CR33,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":21,"textReviewsCount":2751,"name":"Rain","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/2846645-rain","contributor":null,"id":2846645},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A14TMRE3HEQM8N":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A14TMRE3HEQM8N"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A14TMRE3HEQM8N\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}":{