view:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.keZZDKnrwITtlM04NaQ0tQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.keZZDKnrwITtlM04NaQ0tQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:88350974"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1610565320053,"createdAt":1610396456195,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1610396508053,"text":"This book and the MCs were super unexpected. I've always been unsure of this genre and was uncertain if this alpha-omega read would be my cup of tea, my worries were for nothing. I found myself getting lost in the world and MCs Aimes had created, finished this thinking bloody hell I want book two.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFated mates, organised crime, revenge, a possessive and dark Alpha male, a fab heroine, and murder and intrigue make this one great ride. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI loved Dahlia Lundin - she's a fierce and resilient omega that shows the perceptions of omegas as weak is horribly wrong. Nikolai Skolov is a formidable and uber dominant Alpha, determined to protect his family and make the monster of their childhood pay. Finally getting his hands on his fated mate who happens to be the daughter of his enemy, he has no plans to become an 'Alpha-bitch' consumed by his mate, but what he does not count on is Dahlia, how she makes him feel and what she makes him crave.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eGoing in my re-read pile.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eWarning/Potential Trigger:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"2d8177ae-3952-48c7-9ee0-ba3bebebd1fe\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"2d8177ae-3952-48c7-9ee0-ba3bebebd1fe\"\u003eOmegas are biologically driven to desire Alphas and have no control over their sexual urges - so issues/questions around consent really pop up at the start, something about how things were depicted led to me not being horrified.\u003c/label\u003e","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2UPCB942N4K7S\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}"},"likeCount":14,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":8},"User:10821438":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":10821438,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1619878776i/10821438._UY200_CR33,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":72,"textReviewsCount":1418,"name":"Lori R.","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/10821438-lori-r","contributor":null,"id":10821438},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2WL9FG47U62TN":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2WL9FG47U62TN"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2WL9FG47U62TN\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2WL9FG47U62TN","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2WL9FG47U62TN"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/10821438?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3651904414"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.5Hh8oggJwudcAkDkn6bDrA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.5Hh8oggJwudcAkDkn6bDrA","creator":{"__ref":"User:10821438"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1612202569481,"createdAt":1609527079849,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1609865962236,"text":"Holy HOT Alpha!!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlison is an amazingly talented writer. She has once again WOWed me with her masterfully penned story in the Omegaverse world with the sexiest of Alphas and the most beautiful omegas who are just a tad bit on the defiant side. Which makes the Alphas a little more aggressive. But is that really such a bad thing? *heart eyes*\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMs. Aimes created a world that felt so real, with rich and vivid descriptions, I swear I was watching a movie play out in front of me. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis well-written story was full of powerful moments that made my heart beat faster, and fantasize about being a certain red-skinned, horned Alpha’s obedient omega. It made me want to purr. I would submit and beg in a heartbeat if I had an Alpha like Nikolai. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eYou know those heroes we love that are all jealous and possessive and growly and protective? Yeah, that’s Nikolai. And you guys...he literally growls. \u003cbr /\u003eAll. \u003cbr /\u003eThe. \u003cbr /\u003eTime. \u003cbr /\u003eAnd that makes Dahlia shiver and tingle and swoon...among other things. And you guys...it made ME shiver and tingle and swoon, too. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBig ol’ growly, possessive Alpha? \u003cbr /\u003eYES. PLEASE. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnd the feels...they were everywhere in this story! Pretty much every page was filled with something that made me feel way deep down inside. With every turn of the page I was feeling one emotion or another...pain or passion or love or heartache or anger or tingles or fear or happiness...there was always something. This story has it all. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI could feel the power, I could hear those growls, I could feel that bond. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIs there anything hotter than a strong, possessive, protective alpha who is brought to his knees by an omega that he loves with all his heart and would die for?! GEEZ. These two were FIRE. The connection and chemistry and intoxicating passion between them made my Kindle sizzle. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI was ready for the dark and gritty. \u003cbr /\u003eI was ready to devour. \u003cbr /\u003eBut I was not ready for my heart to be stolen. But that’s okay, Nikolai can have it. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI absolutely loved this fabulously written Sci-Fi romance with tons of dark and delicious alpha goodness. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIt was intense. \u003cbr /\u003eIt was intoxicating.\u003cbr /\u003eIt was scorching and sexy and utterly filthy. \u003cbr /\u003eIt was UNPUTDOWNABLE. \u003cbr /\u003eAnd the best part? It rocked my fucking socks off. I love when that happens.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2WL9FG47U62TN\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}"},"likeCount":13,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":7},"User:89162121":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":89162121,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1609648104i/89162121._UY200_CR25,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":1570,"name":"Melluvsbooks","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/89162121-melluvsbooks","contributor":null,"id":89162121},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2OH7YY9I08MWY":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2OH7YY9I08MWY"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2OH7YY9I08MWY\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.MQ1X-qLSE3uq-oEF\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2OH7YY9I08MWY","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2OH7YY9I08MWY"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.MQ1X-qLSE3uq-oEF","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.MQ1X-qLSE3uq-oEF"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"did-not-finish","displayName":"Did Not Finish","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to