g","name":"alien-hero","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=alien-hero"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"alien-heroes","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=alien-heroes"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"ass-of-a-hero","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=ass-of-a-hero"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"babies-in-the-hea","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=babies-in-the-hea"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"bad-parents","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=bad-parents"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"best-heroes","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=best-heroes"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"best-heroine","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=best-heroine"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"betrayal","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2612699?shelf=betrayal"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3661254115"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.iULQ7lqXb_l77ZDS3cj4BQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.iULQ7lqXb_l77ZDS3cj4BQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:2612699"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1669523913294,"createdAt":1613515316118,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1613534772157,"text":"OMG! This Book Will Burn You! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe first thing you have to do is to put aside your thoughts that these creatures are human. They are not. They are alien and primal beasts. They function on pure animal instict with all the trappings of a civilization but violent, territorial, and sexual. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThere world is ice and cold and brutal... as are the males\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1613534764i/30880257._SX540_.jpg\" height=\"100\" alt=\"description\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Alphas are cruel, vicious, mean, violent, aggressive, and possessive, and very Ruthless. This is Nikolai Skolov. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1613534352i/30880254._SY540_.jpg\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" alt=\"description\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAnd his newest possession is Dalhia Lundin. The daughter of his greatest enemy. She is his obsession. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1613534585i/30880256._SY540_.jpg\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" alt=\"description\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Omega’s are born to bend to the will of the Alpha. They have no power to resist the call to submit and give their body to their Alpha. They are born to serve, to be knotted, to be bred. That is their lot in life. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWow! That is a lot to process. And to wrap your mind around. I’m pretty stubborn. I have a mind of my own. I don’t like to be bossed around. At the same time, I can relate to Dalhia. It’s all instinctual. It’s chemical and sexual. And you are helpless. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI went in certain that I was going to hate the hero, Nikolai Skolov . But... He’s complicated. He’s shaped by all that he has lived through. He’s made himself Alpha for his family. For his woman. For his people. I thought I would really dislike him. But I fell in love with him. How could I resist? He is Alpha. He is everything. He has a tender heart. He has a soul that has been hurt, and beaten, and left alone for too long. He is wonderful. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDalhia is kindhearted and sweet and good. Too good for the violent world she lives in. Too good for the violent man who would own her heart and her soul. She is naive and trusting of family that would use her for their own goals. She fell in love long ago with a handsome boy who needed her help. She never stopped loving him. She is stronger than she knows. She has steel in her soul. She can endure for the ones she loves. Her love finally sets Nikolai free. She calms him, sooths him, excites him, and submits to his every command. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis book will make your panties melt! This book is scorching. This book makes me obsessive about the characters and the world and I want more! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAlison Aimes sends her readers into a hot, sexy, new world... and I want more! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1603817493i/30296592.png\" width=\"145\" height=\"115\" alt=\"description\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2B8MFLENNSL28\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}"},"likeCount":11,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":4},"User:147664566":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":147664566,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1694130199i/147664566._UX200_CR0,117,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1076,"textReviewsCount":514,"name":"Soft Nectarine ~","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/147664566-soft-nectarine","contributor":null,"id":147664566},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A25GSKFZH1V81U":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A25GSKFZH1V81U"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A25GSKFZH1V81U\"},\"book\":{\"id