ries.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eomegaverse\u003cbr /\u003eforced proximity 👯\u003cbr /\u003esweet but terrifying mmc \u003cbr /\u003ebody betrayal \u003cbr /\u003evirgin fmc\u003cbr /\u003edub con encounters \u003cbr /\u003efated mates ✨ \u003cbr /\u003efound family \u003cbr /\u003eHEA","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A25GSKFZH1V81U\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}"},"likeCount":11,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":5},"User:86342358":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":86342358,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1643211626i/86342358._UX200_CR0,11,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":55,"textReviewsCount":107,"name":"Millie","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/86342358-millie","contributor":null,"id":86342358},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AZ6ANXM96GG08":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AZ6ANXM96GG08"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AZ6ANXM96GG08\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.MQ1X-qLSE3uq-oEF\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AZ6ANXM96GG08","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AZ6ANXM96GG08"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.MQ1X-qLSE3uq-oEF","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.MQ1X-qLSE3uq-oEF"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/86342358?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"nastay","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/86342358?shelf=nastay"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"omegaverse","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/86342358?shelf=omegaverse"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/8211569742"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.dXVCJFIA2JLLLzg-Cuz1Ww":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.dXVCJFIA2JLLLzg-Cuz1Ww","creator":{"__ref":"User:86342358"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1769637611093,"createdAt":1767613050533,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1767613054028,"text":"Sci-fi ish mafia omegaverse with mystery and a bit of fantasy too.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1767612780i/37439756._SX540_.jpg\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003ePlot\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDahlia Lundin is an omega \"sold\" to Nikolai Skolov by her father as a debt payment. Lundins and Skolovs are both powerful mafia families and are feuding with one another. We figured out during the \"payment meeting\" that Dahlia and Nikolai are fated mates. Dahlia was hopeful with her new match, hoping Nikolai is the same boy she met long ago. Nikolai wanted her since the first time they met, but he also needed her to use her omega gift to save his family.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eReview\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI thought I would like this more. I genuinely just read this for the omegaverse part, but was hit by a ton of... magic, sci-fi, mystery, politics. It's very plot heavy, though the smut is delicious, and romance is definitely there. I do have a bit of complaints though.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFirst, the hero. I seriously don't get the guy. He knows Dahlia was being treated poorly by her family, and he wants her taken care of, yet he's doing everything but communicating. He spanks her and put her in some kind of fridge to the point she wanted to kill herself. ALL AVOIDABLE btw with a bit of communicating.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1767612780i/37439757._SY540_.jpg\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIt also is just a bit of a contradiction. If we only see him from her perspective it would have made sense why he was being so rough. He didn't love her yet. But him, in his pov, being like \"oh i want her, i want to take care of her\" and then proceeding to threaten her and refuse to offer help or give clear communication is just??? weird!!!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAlso weird: He was being so forceful because he was trying to awaken her magic so he could save his family and solve mystery. The times Dahlia's magic are strongest was when they were fucking and they were happy. And then he proceed to be rough and threaten her?? Nikolai had to be TOLD by a fucking DOCTOR who had to STUDY a book to figure out he had to be nice to her.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/hostedimages/1767612780i/37439758._SY540_.jpg\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eExcuse moi??? I thought it was fucking obvious?? Need magic=magic when happy=don't threaten 👉 make omega happy, get magic.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDoes it really take a group of men in a council meeting and a doctor doing research to figure out that in order to get the magic an omega needs to be happy?? One woman would have solved it in a second. Or you know, you would've figured it out yourself if you were just a DECENT man.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThen after knowing that they're like \"Well, we're fucked\". I don't know guys, why don't we just... communicate???\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1605640702ra/30390914.gif\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNo wonder they can't solve the mystery for fifteen fucking years. Also speaking of the mystery, it is all so very obvious who did the murdering and everything. You could see it a mile away.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAs for the omega, Dahlia. I'm also annoyed at her at one point. She refused to help Skolovs and communicate too, even though she knew her family was bad and guilty. She says, \"I won't betray my family, my sister\". I don't know, why don't you make a deal with the Skolovs to spare the innocents instead of refusing to help justice altogether? Seems a bit weird. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHer denial gets tiring after a while too. While her sister was saved so she has no other reason to not help the Skolovs, she kept saying \"oh but my mother\" and \"oh i can't betray my family\". GIRL??? The mother who told you to kill yourself? The family that sold you and mistreated you?? Get a grip. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1767612780ra/37439759.gif\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThere is some good bit though. There's a reason this is all fantasy. The man apologised. Yeah, you heard that right. An alpha man in omegaverse says \"I'm sorry.\"\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://images.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1767612780ra/37439760.gif\" class=\"gr-hostedUserImg\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIt became better after that part honestly, though the author went back and forth with making him good and then an ass and then good again.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAlso why is he called \"King\"? The mafia Brotherhood seemed more like a council to me. Calling himself king should be like... weird and out of place, yk. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAs for the good stuff. Romance part is good I guess. Hero was sweet toward the end and lost his earlier personality. The whole \"fated mate\" works well, I just wished we see more of their personality outside the plot. For the smut, it was hot, and there's smut throughout, but the plot is heavier toward the end with less and less smut.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eConclusion\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI feel like the first half doesn't have good romance but has good smut, and the second half has good romance and less good smut. Plot on murderers and mystery are infuriating for me because they just went about it all wrong, and wasted so much time. But they did get there eventually. Characters are infuriating at times but it works.","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AZ6ANXM96GG08\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.MQ1X-qLSE3uq-oEF\"}}"},"likeCount":10,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":2},"User:79319713":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":79319713,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1752195813i/79319713._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":395,"textReviewsCount":1939,"name":"Kate V","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/79319713-kate-v","contributor":null,"id":79319713},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQ3K24PK0GM3":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQ3K24PK0GM3"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQ3K24PK0GM3\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.MQ1X-qLSE3uq-oEF\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQ3K24PK0GM3","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQ3K24PK0GM3"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.MQ1X-qLSE3uq-oEF","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.MQ1X-qLSE3uq-oEF"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/79319713?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3804325017"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.LgT8i_WaJcNVvleV6SU2HA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.LgT8i_WaJcNVvleV6SU2HA","creator":{"__ref":"User:79319713"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1702941297773,"createdAt":1611939064473,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1611944398046,"text":"4.75 Smutty Omegaverse Light Stars!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis is the first book in Aimes' Mafia Omegaverse series and I really loved this story about Nikolai and Dahlia. I'm always hesitant to pick up an Omegaverse because some are entirely too dark for me. But I would classify this as light with just the right amount of heat.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNikolai and Dahlia meet at a young age and recognize what they are to each other - fated mates. However, due to the circumstances of their families and their age, they part ways but not before Nikolai says he will be back for her one day. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSeveral years later, Dahlia has suffered and grown up feeling like a pawn within the world her father is a part of and with no control over her future. She despises her omega nature and wants to be free. Free to make her own choices and save her sister the fate of also being a pawn. It quickly becomes clear to Dahlia that her father owes money to Nikolai (who has risen high in power) and ends up as payment for his debts, becoming the property of Nikolai. There is a long standing fued between Nikolai and her father and he plans to have and keep her, as well as use her gift (the sight) to bring justice to his family. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHowever, Nikolai quickly realizes that having a fated mate proves to be much different than he was expecting and their relationship can either make their bond strong and resilient or crumble and ruin them. It's evident to both of them that their fated mate bond can be a strength in their fight against Dahlia's father and their quest to find out who is behind some nefarious actions should they choose to nurture it. But the matter of trusting one another is more difficult than either one of them expected.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWithout giving too much away, the suspense and action revolving around their budding relationship is exciting and very well written. I was only annoyed a few times at Nikolai for being so stubborn which is where my rating came from. I was on the edge of my seat waiting to see what would happen and I truly enjoyed the twists and turns. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDahlia was such a great heroine. I loved that she was strong in her own way and really shined by the end. She was kind, loyal, compassionate, persevering and tender-hearted. I also loved Nikolai's siblings and I'm interested in their stories. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhat I loved most about Nikolai is that he recognized Dahlia's worth and strived to make her see that as well. Nikolai taught her that the lioness does not try to be the lion. A lioness embraces her role as the lioness. He helps her to see that she is powerful and strong and should never mistake her meekness for weakness. He was such a typical alpha but so swoon worthy. I loved his controlling and possessive nature and his almost teddy bear change in character with Dahlia. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOverall, a great read with a wonderful ending that left me smiling and rooting for this couple.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2LQ3K24PK0GM3\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.MQ1X-qLSE3uq-oEF\"}}"},"likeCount":9,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":5},"User:80698268":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":80698268,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1708481473i/80698268._UX200_CR0,116,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":536,"textReviewsCount":2589,"name":"Jac K","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/80698268-jac-k","contributor":null,"id":80698268},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2DCB4V4V4Y8WT":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2DCB4V4V4Y8WT"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2DCB4V4V4Y8WT\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2DCB4V4V4Y8WT","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2DCB4V4V4Y8WT"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/80698268?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"omegaverse","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/80698268?shelf=omegaverse"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"smut","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/80698268?shelf=smut"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/7060613037"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.8mJ9_yNGUki0hDcqsxo4HQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.8mJ9_yNGUki0hDcqsxo4HQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:80698268"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1769637688902,"createdAt":1733449250048,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1733449255538,"text":"Another one I read well before the holiday, so this isn’t the freshest. It’s a unique/odd world that wasn’t totally fleshed out, but it sounded like there are different alien species (maybe) that form some sort of mobster committee of crime lords. I’m not sure if they’re all alphas, but many of them are and they have stables of Omegas with a Prime Omega that (I think) he has his kids with. As common in most Omegaverse reads, the alphas are on top with all the power and the omegas are on the bottom and largely controlled by their body responses. She will eventually “tame” her alpha, but it takes a while. So, FYI if that isn’t you’re thing.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNikolai met Dahlia when they were kids when he was in a desperate situation with his siblings. The two knew they had a connection, and he vowed to return for her. The book opens many years later with him fulfilling that pledge. Within the first few chapters, we learn \u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"c45d9a18-8440-4659-be35-9ffc4a9113c4\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"c45d9a18-8440-4659-be35-9ffc4a9113c4\"\u003e they are fated mates\u003c/label\u003e which is very rare, but not surprising with what we had been told and shown up to that point.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe rest is a lot of smut and some tension because Nikolai wants Dahlia to use her Omega gift to help him finally get his revenge on her abusive, murdering father which she is resistant to. At first this made sense because she was trying to protect her sister, but I started to lose patience with her after he resolved that for her, and she still continued to be obstinate. \u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"bc7e583c-102b-4a7c-9d48-125271cf2b25\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"bc7e583c-102b-4a7c-9d48-125271cf2b25\"\u003e Add in her decision at the end to let the murdering villain escape who had just tried to kill her bond mate and tried to kill then kidnap her \u003cb\u003eAND\u003c/b\u003e wouldn’t hesitate to do so again, and I lost ALL respect for Dum-Dum Dahlia.\u003c/label\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMy biggest grump was how long the push pull went on. I prefer it when my H and h work as a team against the baddies rather than battling each other, and this dynamic started to drag at times. Dahlia waffling for her abusive family that has treated her like crap and Nikolai being an ass because he’s pissed that she’s prioritizing her terrible family. On and on… blah blah blah. With loads of BBS and sex.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cu\u003eBottom Line\u003c/u\u003e- I liked it, but I didn’t love it. I thought it ran too long for a book heavily smut based, and Dahlia REALLY pushed my patience with her dumb devotion to assholes. I thought the twist was fairly obvious and guessed correctly mid-book.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIt looks like the next book will follow the same formula, another omega that is torn between her fated mate that has 100% been wronged by her evil family or friends (in this case murdered H’s mother and kidnaped his siblings) and her waffling between loyalties… no thanks.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cu\u003eSafety\u003c/u\u003e- \u003ci\u003e Unlike most of the Alpha crime heads, he had no stable of omegas, indentured or otherwise, and no long line of official offspring or bastards, either. At age twenty-eight, that was almost unheard of. He fucked when he needed release, but until now he’d never had an omega of his own. He’d known, after meeting her, no one else would do.\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2DCB4V4V4Y8WT\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}"},"likeCount":8,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":2},"User:96777068":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":96777068,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1556828624i/96777068._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":16,"textReviewsCount":46,"name":"Chrissy Russo","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/96777068-chrissy-russo","contributor":null,"id":96777068},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A31Y5XX65Z0P7Z":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A31Y5XX65Z0P7Z"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A31Y5XX65Z0P7Z\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A31Y5XX65Z0P7Z","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A31Y5XX65Z0P7Z"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"to-read","displayName":"Want to Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_wtr","sortOrder":0,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/96777068?shelf=to-read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3711420389"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.5hWius7fCCvFwOBFUug3iQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.5hWius7fCCvFwOBFUug3iQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:96777068"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1614631546041,"createdAt":1608741614829,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1609819952903,"text":"This book is a combination of my two favorite themes: mafia and Omegaverse. The writing was excellent, as was the plot. I liked how the Alpha/Omega roles were explored and I especially loved how the h and H fought each other in the first half of the book. My one complaint was that it would have been nice if the H stayed celibate while waiting for the h instead of getting plenty of action. I still think the book deserves five stars though, it was written so well and kept me hooked to the end. The twist at the end was one I did not see coming. There was plenty of action and suspense and the sex scenes were ultra hot. I can't wait to see what's to come with the brothers' books too, especially after reading that bonus epilogue!","rating":0,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A31Y5XX65Z0P7Z\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}"},"likeCount":8,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":3},"User:50314367":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":50314367,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":102,"textReviewsCount":1091,"name":"BeeKay","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/50314367-beekay","contributor":null,"id":50314367},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2EXUZLPA7JHOX":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2EXUZLPA7JHOX"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2EXUZLPA7JHOX\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2EXUZLPA7JHOX","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2EXUZLPA7JHOX"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"anti-hero","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=anti-hero"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"four-star-read","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=four-star-read"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=paranormal"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"sci-fi","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=sci-fi"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"aliens","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=aliens"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"2020-books","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50314367?shelf=2020-books"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3729568316"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.KYiqrnj-JaTw3TBSPKrUXw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.KYiqrnj-JaTw3TBSPKrUXw","creator":{"__ref":"User:50314367"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1610390313556,"createdAt":1609523923212,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1609548952853,"text":"A great start to the series!!! Nikolai and Dahlia's story was more than Alpha and Omega!\u003cbr /\u003e******\u003cbr /\u003eRating: 4 Stars\u003cbr /\u003eSteam: 4 flames\u003cbr /\u003eGenre: Sci-fi / Alien / Omegaverse / Fated Mates\u003cbr /\u003e******\u003cbr /\u003eNikolai, the Ruthless King, Alpha. He has suffered and sacrificed for years to protect his family and get to where he is now. There is only one thing missing. Taking the Omega daughter from the man that ruined his childhood.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDahlia, sassy, strong, Omega. She has suffered at the hands of her Prime Omega mother and Alpha Father. Her father has lost some wagers and in order to pay his debt, he is giving Dahlia to his debt holder. Is it worse to be at home and confined to the house and treated like dirt or given away to an unknown Alpha...or is he unknown? \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis book was filled with betrayal, deceit, darkness, danger, and determination. Both Nikolai and Dahlia are trying to protect themselves, but should they be protecting themselves from each other, or are their outside influences that are much more dangerous. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere were twists, turns, steam, intrigue, romance, and growth between the two characters. These two definitely grew! Ruthless King had a fantastic story that kept me engaged well into the night. I read this in one sitting because I was so enthralled I couldn't put it down. I just knew there was something going on, but just couldn't put my finger on it. It was suspenseful and did I mention steamy? \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAs one of the only Omegaverse books I have ever read, and only my second book by Alison Aimes I was pleased with the writing, story, characters, and I am a sucker for fated mates. I will definitely keep reading this series. Also, DO NOT FORGOT TO DOWNLOAD THE BONUS EPILOGUE it will give you insight into the next book and it was great! I look forward to more Ruthless Warlords and can't wait for book 2!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis gets a big thumbs up recommendation from me!","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2EXUZLPA7JHOX\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}"},"likeCount":7,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:52957386":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":52957386,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1456615487i/52957386._UX200_CR0,50,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":575,"textReviewsCount":1270,"name":"Melanie A.","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/52957386-melanie-a","contributor":null,"id":52957386},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3A3SYP9VQ6J2P":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3A3SYP9VQ6J2P"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3A3SYP9VQ6J2P\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3A3SYP9VQ6J2P","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3A3SYP9VQ6J2P"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"d