view/list/98512744?shelf=mutual-respect"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"overstuffed-plot","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/98512744?shelf=overstuffed-plot"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"repetitious","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/98512744?shelf=repetitious"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"strong-heroine","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/98512744?shelf=strong-heroine"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"well-edited","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/98512744?shelf=well-edited"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"well-written","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/98512744?shelf=well-written"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3776596092"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.w33vq06aRGXQNtlSKIc_HQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.w33vq06aRGXQNtlSKIc_HQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:98512744"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1684109292227,"createdAt":1618495882491,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1618496097388,"text":"This is the first in the author's Omegaverse/Sci-Fi/Mafia series centering on five siblings, their efforts to avenge childhood tragedies, and the partners they meet along the way. While it's a standalone in terms of the MC, certain lines of action will continue in subsequent books. While this has \"dark\" moments (the H's memories of past traumas), he doesn't harm his Omega. Side Note: In terms of genre, I don't understand the difference between \"Fated Mates\" and \"Omegaverse;\" I realize that the former can apply to other sub-genres, such as \"Shifter.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHere, we get family head Alpha Nikolai and his efforts to indict the rival mob boss he thinks killed members of his family. Part of his revenge plan includes taking the latter's Omega daughter, Dahlia, rumored to have the gift of second sight that will enable Nikolai to finally prove her father's guilt. If he starts to have feelings for her, well, that's not going to deter him -- or will it?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI enjoyed and highly recommend this book, and will be reading the rest of the series. Five aspects in particular appealed to me:\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e1) The worldbuilding is excellent: the geographical, economic, political, and social aspects are defined, detailed, and well-explained. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e2) While all the usual Omegaverse tropes exist (heat, knotting), Ms. Aimes' intervention -- each Omega possesses a \"gift\" similar to an X-Men superpower -- allows Dahlia more agency and power than is usual in this genre. In addition, the \"cinematic\" nature of Dahlia's sight was an interesting angle. Side Note: Her race's physical characteristics resemble Tokein's elves.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e3) The conflict between the couple is seemingly insurmountable since both are loyal to their own families; this creates organic, high-stakes tension. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e4) Both were likeable, fully-fleshed out characters with complex backstories, and achieved growth. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e5) The prose was well-edited with no errors that I saw and detailed enough without turning into info-dump.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI did have two problems. First, the length is unnecessary: after a while, Nikolai and Dahlia's back-and-forth became repetitious as we heard more than once about his inability to feel and hers to trust. Second, the ending was too stuffed with OTT plot points: \u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"945cb5de-cde1-46f3-9566-9a81fadc6baa\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"945cb5de-cde1-46f3-9566-9a81fadc6baa\"\u003ebattles, big reveals, murders\u003c/label\u003e. Often authors think that more is \"more,\" when actually it's often \"too much,\" and, ironically, \"not enough\" since the sheer multitude of events and speed at which they unfold don't allow for development. In this case, for example, given all the story space devoted to Dahlia's father, it felt anti-climactic \u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" class=\"spoiler__control\" aria-label=\"The following text has been marked spoiler. Toggle checkbox to reveal or hide.\" onchange=\"this.labels[0].setAttribute('aria-hidden', !this.checked);\" id=\"8846e6fe-4a1f-4b99-a0e0-d92251722ba0\" /\u003e\u003clabel aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"spoiler\" for=\"8846e6fe-4a1f-4b99-a0e0-d92251722ba0\"\u003ewhen his off-page death was reported. And perhaps because I just read this plot twist in another book, I'm over the \"Faking The Dead\" trope -- the Skolov family had enough motivation to continue searching for the killers without that unnecessary incentive \u003c/label\u003e.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e4 stars. While the twist at the end isn't a complete surprise given the hints we're given, it was still clever. I believe we'll get one of the brothers' stories next.","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A37V9I552BX9K8\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}"},"likeCount":8,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:46558106":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":46558106,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1612366487i/46558106._UY200_CR33,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1,"textReviewsCount":6,"name":"Starfall","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/46558106-starfall","contributor":null,"id":46558106},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1IB7X5KWWOHQ3":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1IB7X5KWWOHQ3"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1IB7X5KWWOHQ3\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1IB7X5KWWOHQ3","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1IB7X5KWWOHQ3"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/46558106?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3722597518"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.DJlqjuaVpdGRBPx1y-WB5g":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.DJlqjuaVpdGRBPx1y-WB5g","creator":{"__ref":"User:46558106"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1612202569739,"createdAt":1609184325662,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1609184376961,"text":"Alison Aimes is one of my favorite authors and Ruthless King is now on my top 3 list. While many authors just play around with the concept of an “alpha,” this story takes it to a whole new level of commitment. In this particular book, across the galaxy, beings are either alphas, betas, or omegas, with betas and omegas being the serving class (in different ways). There are other sub-castes, which the book doesn’t go to far into but among the omegas, a female can be a “prime omega” which is an omega of great worth to her “owner.” This is Dahlia. She is a complex being - not an empty-headed waif. My point being that the world building is very good (not that I expected anything else)! The Alpha, Nikolai, was definitely the stuff of fantasy and blended a lot of what we readers love into one being - alpha, strong, commanding, virile, red skinned, horned, knotted, protective, loving, fated... hopefully you get the idea! The love scenes were hot, but the beginning when Dahlia is first on “display” and Nikolai’s reaction really was a fanning moment! :-D\u003cbr /\u003eI am SO looking forward to the next book (Alpha has delicious Alpha brothers)!\u003cbr /\u003ePut this series on your reading list to toast up on those cold winter nights!\u003cbr /\u003e(I received an advanced reader copy in exchange for my honest review.)","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1IB7X5KWWOHQ3\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.-O-J7qJbFw-gisg2\"}}"},"likeCount":7,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":1},"User:57380683":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":57380683,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1481663998i/57380683._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":44,"textReviewsCount":900,"name":"Hart's Reader Group","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/57380683-hart-s-reader-group","contributor":null,"id":57380683},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ATGKR82Q4F325":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ATGKR82Q4F325"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ATGKR82Q4F325\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.pWc7wqpPyAo8nNTC\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ATGKR82Q4F325","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ATGKR82Q4F325"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.pWc7wqpPyAo8nNTC","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.pWc7wqpPyAo8nNTC"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/57380683?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"alpha-protector","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/57380683?shelf=alpha-protector